course: dictionary
lesson: 14342
title: What is an octopod?
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: An octopod is an animal with eight arms or legs. Octo- is a clue: it means eight, as in octopus. Scientists use octopod as a group name for animals like the octopus.
explain: «The octopod curled its eight arms around the rock.» Count the arms in the sentence and it fits. If you read the words around octopod, the clues tell you it is an animal with eight arms.
explain: Squid and cuttlefish are not octopods. They have eight arms and two longer tentacles, so scientists sort them into a different group. Always check the details before you decide.
explain: Octopod can also be a science fiction word. «The robot was an octopod with eight metal legs» describes a machine built like an eight-legged animal. In this story, the word is used for a robot, not a real sea creature.
fact: Octopod is a noun (an octopod, octopods) and an adjective (octopod).
fact: «Octopod» means an animal with eight arms or legs, especially an octopus.
fact: «Octopods» are members of the group of sea animals that includes octopuses.
fact: Squid and cuttlefish have eight arms plus two longer tentacles, so they are not counted as octopods.
fact: In science fiction, an eight-legged robot or alien can be called an octopod.
exercise: «The octopod curled its eight arms around the rock.» What does octopod mean? | A fish with a long tail | A sea plant with eight leaves | *An animal with eight arms or legs | A bird with two wings
exercise: «Squid have eight arms and two long tentacles, so a squid is not an octopod.» Why is a squid not an octopod? | *It has two extra long tentacles as well as eight arms | It has no arms at all | It lives on land | It has only four legs
exercise: In «the octopod robot walked across the moon», what kind of word is octopod? | A verb | *An adjective, describing the robot | A capital letter | A full stop
test: «The aquarium had an octopod with eight arms that curled round the glass.» What is an octopod? | *An animal with eight arms or legs | A type of fish with fins | A kind of boat | A sea plant
test: Which animal is NOT an octopod? | A member of the octopus group | *A squid, which has eight arms and two long tentacles | An octopus
exam: In the science fiction film, «the octopod alien landed on the moon with eight metal legs.» What does octopod mean here? | A kind of star | *An animal, or creature, with eight arms or legs | A spaceship with two wings | A moon rock
